Viktor 10.10.2026: «В ~/Documents/AI/DIFFUSION_MODELS_etc у меня дохерища всего… И модели апскейлеров… 637GB золота».

The stage's Upscale… opens a row under its buttons: the upscalers of artwork/upscalers/ (the one picked kept in this browser; 4x_Nomos8kDAT first when it is there) and ×2, ×4. The large picture is a run of its own and the stage follows it; its stage and its card say Upscale ×N and the model; Again upscales the same picture again; To the form takes its words, shape and seed only (an upscale run is not a painter of the form).

Suite: 583/0 in the kitchen.

